  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Child Protection Fund for the National Action Plan for Orphans and Vulnerable Children in Zimbabwe: Contributions to the United Nations Children&apos;s Fund-managed pool is a component of Child Protection Fund for NAP II reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;38,697,000. It works in the following sector(s): Social Protection, Legal and judicial development, Primary education.</narrative>
  </description>
